<Slide
    style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative', padding: 0 }}
    notes={`这是全场最该记住的一页。同一台机器、同一份数据，三个数字。
扫描到 16 进程是 6.93 倍，因为最后要由父进程串行合并，尾部还会不均。
规则计数 4.51 倍，计数的部分几乎线性，但候选生成那一段是零加速——它不规整，慢分片决定收尾。
PageRank 最难看：四进程到 1.8 倍，到 16 进程反而退回 0.96，比串行还慢。而且我把图放大 16 倍再跑，八线程也只有 2.1 倍。所以它的上限是内存带宽，不是同步。
如果有人问为什么还要报这个：一个越并行越慢的层，本身就是结论。`}
>
    <Image src="assets/cityu_logo.png" style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 30, right: 64, width: 90, height: 62 }} />

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 60, left: 64, width: 800, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C72A74', letterSpacing: 1.6 }}>
            3 · RESULTS
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
            Same machine, three ceilings
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Image
        src="assets/fig10_scaling.png"
        style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 176, left: 64, width: 620, height: 418 }}
    />

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 168, left: 740, width: 476, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12, paddingBottom: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 46, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', lineHeight: 1 }}>6.93×</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B6A66', paddingBottom: 4 }}>scan · 16 workers</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6B6A66', lineHeight: 1.5, paddingBottom: 20 }}>
            stops where the parent-side merge starts — Amdahl's serial fraction, measured
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12, paddingBottom: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 46, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', lineHeight: 1 }}>4.51×</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B6A66', paddingBottom: 4 }}>rule counting</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6B6A66', lineHeight: 1.5, paddingBottom: 20 }}>
            counting scales; candidate generation sits at 1× because its cost is data-dependent
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12, paddingBottom: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 46, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C72A74', lineHeight: 1 }}>0.96×</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B6A66', paddingBottom: 4 }}>PageRank · at 16</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6B6A66', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            1.8× at four workers, then it goes backwards — and only 2.1× when the graph is 16× larger
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box
        style={{
            position: 'absolute',
            top: 600,
            left: 740,
            width: 476,
            paddingLeft: 14,
            borderLeft: '3px solid #C72A74',
        }}
    >
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1A1A1A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            First version spawned a pool per stage: 2.6× peak, then <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>slower</span> at
            16. One pool, one reference file per worker: 6.93×.
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 690, left: 64, fontSize: 11, color: '#6B6A66' }}>
        Intel Core i7-12700H · 14 physical cores, 20 threads · 32 GB · timings exclude the serial gunzip
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 690, right: 64, fontSize: 11, color: '#6B6A66' }}>
        04 / 08
    </Text>
</Slide>
